      ],
      "source": "https://talktoannie.com/boonville-indiana-a-historic-gem-in-southern-indiana/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Boonville post office houses a 1941 mural titled 'Boonville Beginnings,' painted by artist Ida Abelman as part of a Treasury Department program.",
